    "title": "Avondale logs 1 scam report in June",
    "text": "Avondale logs 1 scam report in June\nBy\nT. M. HawkOne scam report was recorded in Avondale in June 2026, according to Better Business Bureau.\nThe city had no scam reports in the previous month.\nBBB Scam Tracker lets consumers search reported scams and share their experiences to help others spot similar schemes. The BBB says it reviews each report before publication and does not publicly display the reporter’s name or personal contact information.\nFraud reports have continued to result in substantial financial losses nationwide. The Federal Trade Commission said consumers reported losing more than $12.5 billion to fraud in 2024, a 25% increase from the previous year.\nScam reports in Avondale, CO in June 2026\n| Date | Scam type | Reported loss |\n|---|---|---|\n| June 18 | Phishing | No reported loss |",
    "summary": "Avondale logs 1 scam report in June T. M. HawkOne scam report was recorded in Avondale in June 2026, according to Better Business Bureau. The city had no scam reports in the previous month. BBB Scam Tracker lets consumers search reported scams and share their experiences to help others spot similar schemes. Fraud reports have continued to result in substantial financial losses nationwide. The Federal Trade Commission said consumers reported losing more than $12.5 billion to fraud in 2024, a 25% increase from the previous year.",
